<title>GERMANY: Schwarz Pharma says 96 gp sales up 17.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Schwarz Pharma says 96 gp sales up 17.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MONHEIM, Germany 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				1,195     up 17.5 pct</p>
<p>    Group domestic sales		     580.7   up  9.7 pct</p>
<p>    Group foreign sales			614.0   up 26 pct</p>
<p>	sales in U.S.			    266.2   up 44 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German drugs group is Schwarz Pharma AG. The group also forecast that its 1997 group sales would climb by six to eight percent with profits growing more strongly than that.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
